header
  tsync-export 1 aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb 40 8 /mnt/big disk/Camera 1/P101.MOV
a record beside a file of the right length
  nothing claimed yet                            resume ..... (0 of 5)
  chunks out of order                            resume ##.#. (3 of 5)
  every chunk, the run having died at the end    resume ##### (5 of 5)
  a claim cut short by a crash                   resume ##... (2 of 5)
  a line that is no index ends the record        resume #.... (1 of 5)
  as does one out of range                       resume #.... (1 of 5)
  and one not spelled as it would be written     resume ..... (0 of 5)
a record that is not to be believed
  the file is gone                               start over
  the file is another length                     start over
  other content                                  start over
  another destination                            start over
  cut off inside its header                      start over
no record
  size and time are the manifest's               already there
  the time a coarse filesystem kept              already there
  right size, another time                       start over
  nothing there                                  start over
where a file lands under /out
  asked ""           holds "a.txt"                -> /out/a.txt
  asked ""           holds "docs/deep/b.txt"      -> /out/docs/deep/b.txt
  asked "a.txt"      holds "a.txt"                -> /out/a.txt
  asked "docs/deep/b.txt" holds "docs/deep/b.txt"      -> /out/b.txt
  asked "docs"       holds "docs/deep/b.txt"      -> /out/docs/deep/b.txt
  asked "docs/deep"  holds "docs/deep/b.txt"      -> /out/deep/b.txt
